<title>USA: TABLE - HSB Group Q2 net shr $0.80 vs $0.66.</title>
<headline>TABLE - HSB Group Q2 net shr $0.80 vs $0.66.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD, Conn. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second Quarter ended June 30</p>
<p>				1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.80		    $0.66</p>
<p> Net			   16.4		     13.4</p>
<p> Gross premium	    149.2		    137.7</p>
<p> Avg shrs		    20.5		     20.3</p>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.58		    $1.49</p>
<p> Net			   32.2		     30.4</p>
<p> Gross premium	    305.0		    271.4</p>
<p> Avg			   20.5		     20.3</p>
<p>(All data above in millions except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: HSB Group Inc restated its 1996 results to account for the effects of discontinued operations. The 1996 and 1997 results exclude goodwill amortization related to EIG. The 1996 results exclude the company's minority interest related to EIG.</p>
